flowchart TB
    PDF[Selected proposal PDFs] --> EXT[Extract page text]
    EXT --> CHUNK[Chunk text and preserve metadata]
    CHUNK --> EMBED[Create local embeddings]
    EMBED --> CHROMA[(ChromaDB)]
    CRIT[(SQLite criteria)] --> QUERY[Build criterion retrieval queries]
    CHROMA --> QUERY
    QUERY --> EVID[Retrieved evidence chunks]
    EVID --> API[OpenRouter LLM]
    API --> VALID[Validate evaluation JSON]
    VALID --> SCORE[Calculate weighted score and rank]
    SCORE --> DB[(SQLite results)]
    SCORE --> OUT[Dashboard / JSON export]
